### Parada Certa - API Dispositivos
### Use com a extensão REST Client (humao.rest-client): clique em "Send Request" acima de cada bloco.
### Credenciais do seed de desenvolvimento (db/scripts/02-seed-dev.sql).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5117

### 1) Login do totem
# @name loginTotem
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/dispositivo
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identificador": "TOTEM-0001", "segredo": "segredo-dev-totem-0001" }

### 2) Sinal de cartão (troque a Idempotency-Key para criar um novo; repita a mesma para ver o 200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sinais
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTotem.response.body.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: TOTEM-0001-000001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "totemId": "TOTEM-0001", "tipo": "CARTAO", "uidCartao": "04A1B2C3D4", "dataHora": "2026-11-18T14:32:05-03:00" }

### 3) Sinal de botão
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sinais
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTotem.response.body.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: TOTEM-0001-000002
Content-Type: application/json

{ "totemId": "TOTEM-0001", "tipo": "BOTAO", "dataHora": "2026-11-18T14:33:00-03:00" }

### 4) Heartbeat
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/heartbeats
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTotem.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rssiDbm": -61, "firmwareVersao": "1.0.0", "uptimeSegundos": 3600 }

### 5) Login do gestor
# @name loginGestor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/gestor
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "gestor@paradacerta.dev", "senha": "Gestor@123" }

### 6) Listar totens
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/totens
Authorization: Bearer {{loginGestor.response.body.accessToken}}

### 7) Estado de um totem (online/offline, último sinal e heartbeat)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/totens/1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginGestor.response.body.accessToken}}

### 8) Cadastrar totem (o segredo aparece só nesta resposta)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/totens
Authorization: Bearer {{loginGestor.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identificador": "TOTEM-0002", "paradaId": 1 }

### 9) Desativar totem
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/totens/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{loginGestor.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "INATIVO" }

### 10) Health checks
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
